  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "BBM contained (per liter) 0.25 g NH4Cl, 0.6 g NaH2PO4, 0.1 g KCl, and 2.52 g NaHCO3 with the addition of vitamins and minerals according to Bruce et al. (Environ Microbiol. 1:319-329(1999)) and the appropriate concentration of electron donors and acceptors."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
